  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThere are several places like issues and the [Media Queries 5 spec](https://drafts.csswg.org/mediaqueries-5/) referencing the term \"joint session history\".\n\nThough that term is currently not defined in the HTML spec. It is only mentioned once in an example referring to a Jake diagram.\n\nSebastian",
